              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
              Website live ansehen
            </button>
          </li>

          <!-- Greenchild -->
          <li class="ref-card reveal" aria-labelledby="ref-card-gc-heading">
            <div class="ref-card-top">
              <div class="ref-card-logo-wrap">
                <img src="/client-logos/greenchild.png" alt="Greenchild Logo" class="ref-card-logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="110" height="36">
              </div>
              <span class="case-tag">Klienten-Gewinnungs-System · in 14 Tagen live</span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="ref-card-gc-heading" class="ref-card-title">Greenchild</h3>
            <p class="ref-card-desc">In 3 Wochen von null auf live — und schon in Woche 1 fünf warme, qualifizierte Anfragen (vorher null). Aus Besuchern wurden gebuchte Anfragen.</p>
            <dl class="ref-card-details">
              <div class="ref-detail">
                <dt>Ausgangslage</dt>
                <dd>Start bei null: keine Seite, kein Pfad zur Anfrage. Reichweite sollte entstehen, aber es gab nichts, das daraus gebuchte Erstgespräche macht.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="ref-detail">
                <dt>Was wir gebaut haben</dt>
                <dd>Ein komplettes Klienten-Gewinnungs-System: verkaufsstarke Conversion-Website, automatische Terminbuchung, Follow-up-Automatisierung und Tracking — in 14 Tagen live.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="ref-detail">
                <dt>System</dt>
                <dd>Conversion-Website · automatische Terminbuchung · Follow-up-Automatisierung · Tracking</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
            <div class="ref-card-metric">
              <span class="ref-card-metric-val">5</span>
              <span class="ref-card-metric-label">warme Anfragen in Woche 1 (vorher null)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ref-card-services">Conversion-Website · Terminbuchung · Follow-up</div>
            <button
              class="ref-card-link ref-modal-trigger"
              data-url="https://greenchild-preview.elevo.solutions/de/"
              data-label="Greenchild"
              data-display-url="greenchild-preview.elevo.solutions"
              aria-label="Greenchild Website im Modal ansehen"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
              Website live ansehen
            </button>
          </li>

          <!-- BrandsMarketingLab -->
          <li class="ref-card reveal" aria-labelledby="ref-card-bml-heading">
            <div class="ref-card-top">
              <div class="ref-card-logo-wrap">
                <img src="/client-logos/bml-white.png" alt="BrandsMarketingLab Logo" class="ref-card-logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="36" height="36">
              </div>
              <span class="case-tag">Social-Media-Agentur</span>
            </div>
            <h3 id="ref-card-bml-heading" class="ref-card-title">BrandsMarketingLab</h3>
            <p class="ref-card-desc">Conversion-Website für eine Marketing-Agentur — klare Positionierung und eine durchgehende Strecke, die aus Besuchern gebuchte Anfragen macht.</p>
            <dl class="ref-card-details">
              <div class="ref-detail">
                <dt>Was wir gebaut haben</dt>
                <dd>Eine verkaufsstarke Conversion-Website mit klarer Positionierung, Ergebnis-Showcase und einer durchgehenden Strecke zur Anfrage — schnell, mobil und sauber strukturiert.</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="ref-detail">
                <dt>Fokus</dt>
                <dd>Aus Besuchern werden gebuchte Anfragen: Die Seite führt deine Interessenten gezielt von der Story zum Erstgespräch.</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
            <div class="ref-card-metric">
              <span class="ref-card-metric-val">Live</span>
              <span class="ref-card-metric-label">Jetzt online unter elevo-business.github.io/bml</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ref-card-services">Marken-Website · Mobile-First · Lead-Strecke</div>
            <button
              class="ref-card-link ref-modal-trigger"
              data-url="https://elevo-business.github.io/bml/index.html"
              data-label="BrandsMarketingLab"
              data-display-url="elevo-business.github.io/bml"
              aria-label="BrandsMarketingLab Website im Modal ansehen"
            >
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"/></svg>
              Website live ansehen
            </button>
          </li>

        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
    <section class="ev-section ev-section-alt" aria-labelledby="cta-ref-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ev-final">
          <p class="ev-eyebrow">Dein System</p>
          <h2 id="cta-ref-heading" class="ev-h2">Das nächste Ergebnis könnte deins sein.</h2>
          <p class="ev-final-sub">In 14 Tagen live. Keine qualifizierte Anfrage in 30 Tagen nach Launch? Wir arbeiten kostenlos weiter, bis du sie hast.</p>
          <a href="/kontakt" class="ev-btn ev-btn-primary ev-btn-xl">Kostenloser Funnel-Check</a>
          <p class="ev-final-trust">Antwort innerhalb von 24 Stunden · fester Ansprechpartner · DSGVO-konform</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(casesSchema)} />

  <script>
    const modal = document.getElementById('ref-modal') as HTMLElement;
    const frame = document.getElementById('ref-modal-frame') as HTMLIFrameElement;
    const urlDisplay = document.getElementById('ref-modal-url') as HTMLElement;
    const openBtn = document.getElementById('ref-modal-open-btn') as HTMLAnchorElement;
    const closeBtn = document.getElementById('ref-modal-close') as HTMLButtonElement;
    const backdrop = modal?.querySelector('.ref-modal-backdrop') as HTMLElement;

    let lastFocus: HTMLElement | null = null;

    function openModal(url: string, label: string, displayUrl: string) {
      lastFocus = document.activeElement as HTMLElement;
      frame.src = url;
      frame.title = label;
      urlDisplay.textContent = displayUrl;
      openBtn.href = url;
      modal.classList.add('is-visible');
      document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      requestAnimationFrame(() => { modal.classList.add('is-open'); });
      closeBtn.focus();
    }

    function closeModal() {
      modal.classList.remove('is-open');
      modal.addEventListener('transitionend', () => {
        modal.classList.remove('is-visible');
        frame.src = '';
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
        lastFocus?.focus();
      }, { once: true });
    }

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.ref-modal-trigger').forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const url = btn.dataset.url!;
        const label = btn.dataset.label!;
        const displayUrl = btn.dataset.displayUrl || url;
        openModal(url, label, displayUrl);
      });
    });

    closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', closeModal);
    backdrop?.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Escape' && modal.classList.contains('is-visible')) closeModal();
    });
  </script>

  <style>
    /* Case-Study-Details (Ausgangslage / Was wir gebaut / Stack) */
    .ref-card-details {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: rgba(26, 31, 43, 0.03);
    }
    .ref-detail dt {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .ref-detail dd {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* Modal Trigger Button */
    .ref-modal-trigger {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background var(--transition), border-color var(--transition), color var(--transition);
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .ref-modal-trigger:hover {
      background: var(--accent-glow);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--text-primary);
    }

    /* Modal Overlay */
    .ref-modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9000;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .ref-modal.is-visible {
      display: flex;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .ref-modal.is-open .ref-modal-backdrop {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .ref-modal.is-open .ref-modal-window {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
    }

    /* Backdrop */
    .ref-modal-backdrop {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      background: rgba(26, 31, 43, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Modal Window */
    .ref-modal-window {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      height: min(85vh, 800px);
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: 0 32px 80px rgba(26, 31, 43, 0.12), var(--shadow-blue);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.96) translateY(16px);
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Modal Browser Bar */
    .ref-modal-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .ref-modal-dots {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .ref-modal-dots span {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--text-muted);
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    .ref-modal-dots span:nth-child(1) { background: var(--danger); opacity: 0.8; }
    .ref-modal-dots span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--orange); opacity: 0.8; }
    .ref-modal-dots span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--green); opacity: 0.8; }

    .ref-modal-url-wrap {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: rgba(26,31,43,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .ref-modal-url-wrap svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--green); }
    .ref-modal-url {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .ref-modal-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .ref-modal-open, .ref-modal-close {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background var(--transition), color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .ref-modal-open:hover { background: var(--accent-glow); color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
    .ref-modal-close:hover { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); color: var(--danger); border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.4); }

    /* iFrame */
